@startuml UC8_Matchmaking_UseCase
skinparam linetype ortho
left to right direction

actor Player1
actor Player2

rectangle "Matchmaking System" {
  (Select PvP Mode)
  (Join Matchmaking Queue)
  (Add to waiting queue)
  (Server searches for opponent)
  (Opponent Found?)
  (Found match)
  (Keep waiting)
  (Create Battle Room)
  (Load opponent team)
  (Load opponent stats)
  (Both players notified)
  (Accept Match?)
  (Confirm)
  (Decline)
  (Ready for battle)
  (Return to queue/Main menu)
  (Proceed to Battle)
}

Player1 --> (Select PvP Mode)
Player2 --> (Select PvP Mode)

(Select PvP Mode) --> (Join Matchmaking Queue)
(Join Matchmaking Queue) --> (Add to waiting queue)
(Add to waiting queue) --> (Server searches for opponent) : <<invoke>>

(Server searches for opponent) --> (Opponent Found?)
(Opponent Found?) --> (Found match) : both rank similar
(Opponent Found?) --> (Keep waiting) : timeout/rank gap

(Found match) --> (Create Battle Room) : <<include>>
(Create Battle Room) --> (Load opponent team)
(Create Battle Room) --> (Load opponent stats)

(Load opponent team) --> (Both players notified)
(Load opponent stats) --> (Both players notified)

(Both players notified) --> Player1
(Both players notified) --> Player2

Player1 --> (Accept Match?)
Player2 --> (Accept Match?)

(Accept Match?) --> (Confirm) : Yes
(Accept Match?) --> (Decline) : No

(Confirm) --> (Ready for battle)
(Decline) --> (Return to queue/Main menu)

(Ready for battle) --> (Proceed to Battle)

@enduml
